      <section class="detail-block">
        <h2>Technical Advantages</h2>
        <div class="advantage-grid">
          <div class="advantage-card blue">
            <h3>Dual-Sided</h3>
            <p>Upper and lower rollers provide thorough cleaning of both substrate surfaces in a single pass.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="advantage-card yellow">
            <h3>Integrated Static Control</h3>
            <p>Static elimination runs alongside the cleaning pass to reduce the charge on the board, and with it the electrostatic attraction that pulls particles back to a cleaned surface. How much charge is actually left, and whether dust settles again, are confirmed separately on your own boards at your own line speed and conditions. Neither is guaranteed by the eliminator being fitted.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="advantage-card green">
            <h3>Easy Maintenance</h3>
            <p>Quick-change window structure minimizes downtime during roller and paper cartridge replacement.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
